@host = https://localhost:7226

### Create vehicle successfully
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "А123АА",
  "vin": "WVWZZZ1JZXW000001",
  "brand": "Volkswagen",
  "model": "Golf",
  "year": 2020,
  "mileage": 85000,
  "fuelType": 2
}

### Validation error: VIN must contain exactly 17 characters
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "В456ВВ",
  "vin": "123",
  "brand": "Toyota",
  "model": "Camry",
  "year": 2022,
  "mileage": 30000,
  "fuelType": 1
}

### Conflict: send after the first request to check duplicate handling
POST {{host}}/api/vehicles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plateNumber": "А123АА",
  "vin": "WVWZZZ1JZXW000001",
  "brand": "Volkswagen",
  "model": "Golf",
  "year": 2020,
  "mileage": 85000,
  "fuelType": 2
}
